WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.531 --> 00:00:03.202
- It's not enough to know what you want.

00:00:03.202 --> 00:00:07.484
You have to do what you
want to be what you want.

00:00:07.484 --> 00:00:09.645
I write things that I feel, and then,

00:00:09.645 --> 00:00:11.770
when the books are out, people

00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:13.581
identify themselves with my books.

00:00:13.581 --> 00:00:16.112
I don't imagine myself
sitting in my apartment

00:00:16.112 --> 00:00:19.258
in Rio De Janeiro,
saying, oh, I want to be

00:00:19.258 --> 00:00:22.730
such a successful writer and
people have to read my book.

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:24.459
When you want something, the whole

00:00:24.459 --> 00:00:27.959
universe will conspire for you to have it.

00:00:29.266 --> 00:00:31.751
- He's a Brazilian lyricist and novelist.

00:00:31.751 --> 00:00:33.225
His novel, The Alchemist, has been

00:00:33.225 --> 00:00:35.518
translated into 80 languages.

00:00:35.518 --> 00:00:38.293
He's sold over 200 million
copies of his books

00:00:38.293 --> 00:00:41.497
and is the all-time
best-selling Portuguese author.

00:00:41.497 --> 00:00:43.180
He's Paulo Coelho and here's my

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:45.445
take on his top 10 rules for success.

00:00:45.445 --> 00:00:47.012
Rule number one is my personal favorite,

00:00:47.012 --> 00:00:48.010
and make sure to stick around

00:00:48.010 --> 00:00:49.996
all the way to the end
for some special bonuses.

00:00:49.996 --> 00:00:51.424
And as you watch the clips, if there's

00:00:51.424 --> 00:00:53.932
something Paulo says that
really resonates with you,

00:00:53.932 --> 00:00:56.509
make sure to put it in
the comments in quotes

00:00:56.509 --> 00:01:00.676
so that other people can benefit
and be inspired, as well.

00:01:03.034 --> 00:01:04.845
- You know, it took me years.

00:01:04.845 --> 00:01:08.827
I knew that I want to be a
writer, since I was young

00:01:08.827 --> 00:01:10.731
and have this megalomaniac things

00:01:10.731 --> 00:01:13.690
about being the most
famous writer in the world.

00:01:13.690 --> 00:01:17.190
But it's not enough to know what you want.

00:01:18.672 --> 00:01:23.316
You have to do what you
want to be what you want.

00:01:23.316 --> 00:01:25.418
You know, so a writer implies

00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:28.065
you're writing books.
- Yeah.

00:01:28.065 --> 00:01:30.733
- A gardener implies he gardens.

00:01:30.733 --> 00:01:31.566
You know?

00:01:31.566 --> 00:01:34.005
But if you, I don't know about today, but

00:01:34.005 --> 00:01:37.644
if you talk to your father, your mother,

00:01:37.644 --> 00:01:39.252
if you are from a middle class,

00:01:39.252 --> 00:01:43.419
I want to be a gardener,
your father say, "Oh my, son.

00:01:45.406 --> 00:01:48.239
"Please, go to university."
- Yeah.

00:01:49.202 --> 00:01:50.419
- "Get a diploma, and you can

00:01:50.419 --> 00:01:53.390
"do your gardening during the weekend."

00:01:53.390 --> 00:01:55.317
But you love plants.

00:01:55.317 --> 00:01:56.698
You love the soil.

00:01:56.698 --> 00:01:58.903
You love, you know...

00:01:58.903 --> 00:02:01.819
But, at the end of the
day, you are convinced

00:02:01.819 --> 00:02:05.813
and this is not good for the
person who is being convinced

00:02:05.813 --> 00:02:08.483
and for the person who
is trying to convince.

00:02:08.483 --> 00:02:10.503
You are creating this order of

00:02:10.503 --> 00:02:12.503
frustration around them.

00:02:13.719 --> 00:02:15.380
- Your background is
fairly well documented,

00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:18.048
the things you went through
which have shaped you.

00:02:18.048 --> 00:02:19.931
How much of that is really behind you?

00:02:19.931 --> 00:02:22.067
How much do those ghosts still haunt you?

00:02:22.067 --> 00:02:24.517
The involvement in issues that

00:02:24.517 --> 00:02:27.266
got you imprisoned and tortured.

00:02:27.266 --> 00:02:30.016
You know, the drug use and so on.

00:02:32.305 --> 00:02:34.608
- I am myself and my circumstances.

00:02:34.608 --> 00:02:36.021
I think that...

00:02:36.021 --> 00:02:39.438
Like the Spanish philosopher used to say,

00:02:40.457 --> 00:02:41.665
"So who am I?

00:02:41.665 --> 00:02:43.823
"I'm a sum of all the experiences

00:02:43.823 --> 00:02:45.194
"that I've lived in my life."

00:02:45.194 --> 00:02:47.827
That said, of course, I don't look back

00:02:47.827 --> 00:02:51.994
because, if I look back, I
may become a sort of salt.

00:02:54.224 --> 00:02:55.620
So I try to live my life here.

00:02:55.620 --> 00:02:58.706
But it is the sum of difficult moments,

00:02:58.706 --> 00:03:02.572
good moments, experiences
that I had in my life,

00:03:02.572 --> 00:03:04.501
that brought me here in front

00:03:04.501 --> 00:03:07.810
of this camera, talking to you.

00:03:07.810 --> 00:03:11.874
You don't live your life
in this capitalistic sense

00:03:11.874 --> 00:03:15.914
that you accumulate knowledge
as you're accumulating money.

00:03:15.914 --> 00:03:17.772
No, no, no, no, no.

00:03:17.772 --> 00:03:20.535
Life is about the present moment

00:03:20.535 --> 00:03:22.903
and you're here, you're here now.

00:03:22.903 --> 00:03:25.887
And then you have an idea
or you have some thing

00:03:25.887 --> 00:03:28.804
but that may be a root in your past

00:03:30.078 --> 00:03:31.274
but you don't know.

00:03:31.274 --> 00:03:32.932
So what I try to do is to live

00:03:32.932 --> 00:03:36.858
my life as full, as intensely as I can.

00:03:36.858 --> 00:03:38.855
- You're one of the world's
most widely read authors

00:03:38.855 --> 00:03:40.653
but you're more than just a writer.

00:03:40.653 --> 00:03:42.803
You've become something
of a spiritual icon.

00:03:42.803 --> 00:03:44.904
How do you regard yourself nowadays?

00:03:44.904 --> 00:03:47.525
- I would totally disagree with you here.

00:03:47.525 --> 00:03:50.188
I'm not a spiritual master or anything.

00:03:50.188 --> 00:03:51.825
I am someone who is,

00:03:51.825 --> 00:03:53.506
well, walking through this life

00:03:53.506 --> 00:03:55.120
and learning at the same time.

00:03:55.120 --> 00:03:58.020
What I do is to share my experience

00:03:58.020 --> 00:04:00.089
because I think life is about sharing.

00:04:00.089 --> 00:04:02.172
So in this case, I write.

00:04:03.080 --> 00:04:04.636
I write things that I feel.

00:04:04.636 --> 00:04:07.254
And then when the books are out,

00:04:07.254 --> 00:04:09.297
people identify themselves with my books.

00:04:09.297 --> 00:04:12.796
But not with my answers,
mostly with my questions.

00:04:12.796 --> 00:04:14.066
- Well, lets say, I know you've said

00:04:14.066 --> 00:04:16.244
you have nothing to teach but
you have something to share

00:04:16.244 --> 00:04:17.253
but it must put some pressure

00:04:17.253 --> 00:04:18.930
on you when people are
looking for answers.

00:04:18.930 --> 00:04:19.982
Obviously you're touching something

00:04:19.982 --> 00:04:22.713
that people are missing in their lives.

00:04:22.713 --> 00:04:23.711
- Do you believe so?

00:04:23.711 --> 00:04:25.640
(exhales) I don't know, I don't know.

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:27.095
I think that when I write a book,

00:04:27.095 --> 00:04:29.992
I try to understand myself because

00:04:29.992 --> 00:04:32.076
it's not easy to understand yourself.

00:04:32.076 --> 00:04:34.937
Unless you share, as I
said, with someone else.

00:04:34.937 --> 00:04:36.020
So, when I...

00:04:37.363 --> 00:04:42.152
I sit, I have no clear idea
what I'm going to write about.

00:04:42.152 --> 00:04:46.553
Sometimes it is a totally
unknown part of me who does it.

00:04:46.553 --> 00:04:49.017
So, we get inspiration.

00:04:49.017 --> 00:04:51.404
Inspiration meaning getting busy.

00:04:51.404 --> 00:04:54.573
Getting things from outside to inside.

00:04:54.573 --> 00:04:59.196
So my books mostly, they
try to share, to myself,

00:04:59.196 --> 00:05:00.029
who am I?

00:05:00.029 --> 00:05:03.360
Because this constant pressure
of discovering myself.

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:06.105
When I was a child, they
think that all you exist.

00:05:06.105 --> 00:05:07.434
- Right.
- Right?

00:05:07.434 --> 00:05:10.517
And all day, I was by the orange tree

00:05:12.989 --> 00:05:16.869
and I had this sensation that I was alive.

00:05:16.869 --> 00:05:18.174
Do you remember the day that

00:05:18.174 --> 00:05:20.830
you realized that you were alive?

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:21.967
- No, I don't remember that day.

00:05:21.967 --> 00:05:23.467
- I remember so...

00:05:24.917 --> 00:05:26.222
- I wish I did but okay.

00:05:26.222 --> 00:05:29.259
- That day I said, "My God, I am alive.

00:05:29.259 --> 00:05:30.204
"Not only I am alive

00:05:30.204 --> 00:05:33.433
"but I'm not the center of the universe."

00:05:33.433 --> 00:05:36.702
And then I realized that I was alive

00:05:36.702 --> 00:05:40.434
and there was a lot of
things going on outside

00:05:40.434 --> 00:05:41.934
my childish world.

00:05:45.923 --> 00:05:48.237
And so I said I'm going to pay

00:05:48.237 --> 00:05:50.804
attention to what is going on.

00:05:50.804 --> 00:05:52.910
And this is how I survive it.

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:56.589
I think that you have to
take risks, all the time.

00:05:56.589 --> 00:05:59.819
If you don't do that,
you don't move forward.

00:05:59.819 --> 00:06:02.285
We are trying to be too conservative

00:06:02.285 --> 00:06:04.558
in the way that you think life.

00:06:04.558 --> 00:06:07.036
And the results is that
nobody's voice off to say

00:06:07.036 --> 00:06:10.534
I don't agree with
this, I agree with that.

00:06:10.534 --> 00:06:14.201
So we have to push
somehow our individuality

00:06:16.576 --> 00:06:20.138
to make sure that our voice can be heard.

00:06:20.138 --> 00:06:22.906
My personal legend was
always to be a writer

00:06:22.906 --> 00:06:26.323
and finding your personal legend does not

00:06:27.178 --> 00:06:30.364
mean fulfilling your personal legend.

00:06:30.364 --> 00:06:33.634
Because being a writer
means writing books.

00:06:33.634 --> 00:06:36.952
I cannot just sit and
say, okay I'm a writer.

00:06:36.952 --> 00:06:38.691
So you write your first book.

00:06:38.691 --> 00:06:41.067
It may or not be successful.

00:06:41.067 --> 00:06:43.454
Then there's the next
one, there's a third one,

00:06:43.454 --> 00:06:46.582
and, all of a sudden,
you realize that you are.

00:06:46.582 --> 00:06:48.916
Your books are doing very well.

00:06:48.916 --> 00:06:50.666
And you fear success.

00:06:51.794 --> 00:06:53.978
You have this moment that you think,

00:06:53.978 --> 00:06:56.760
oh my gosh, should I write the next book?

00:06:56.760 --> 00:06:58.665
Do I need to be judged again?

00:06:58.665 --> 00:07:00.312
By the critics, et cetera.

00:07:00.312 --> 00:07:01.602
And then you realize that your

00:07:01.602 --> 00:07:05.293
personal legend is about moving on.

00:07:05.293 --> 00:07:06.126
Go.

00:07:06.126 --> 00:07:10.644
If you have a dream of
becoming a writer, write books.

00:07:10.644 --> 00:07:13.249
Don't be paralyzed by
either success or fear.

00:07:13.249 --> 00:07:15.612
So, I'm in the process, I'm on

00:07:15.612 --> 00:07:18.358
the journey, of my personal legend.

00:07:18.358 --> 00:07:20.034
Not to fulfill it but to live

00:07:20.034 --> 00:07:22.815
it as full, as intensely as I can.

00:07:22.815 --> 00:07:25.088
I fought against all odds.

00:07:25.088 --> 00:07:28.064
There's no tradition of a Brazilian

00:07:28.064 --> 00:07:29.843
writer to be translated,

00:07:29.843 --> 00:07:32.770
there is no tradition of being published.

00:07:32.770 --> 00:07:36.520
I am published now, I
think, in 56 languages,

00:07:39.306 --> 00:07:40.673
which is very impressive.

00:07:40.673 --> 00:07:42.524
So, for example, only in India,

00:07:42.524 --> 00:07:44.811
publishing in eight different languages.

00:07:44.811 --> 00:07:48.894
In Spain, publishing in
four different languages.

00:07:50.133 --> 00:07:52.633
So I could never ever dream...

00:07:53.776 --> 00:07:57.006
Well, I don't imagine myself
sitting in my apartment

00:07:57.006 --> 00:07:58.570
in Rio de Janeiro and say,

00:07:58.570 --> 00:08:01.737
"Oh, I want to be such a successful writer

00:08:01.737 --> 00:08:03.525
"and people have to read my book."

00:08:03.525 --> 00:08:05.757
(interviewer laughs)
Because at the end of the day,

00:08:05.757 --> 00:08:09.017
who promotes the book is the reader.

00:08:09.017 --> 00:08:11.582
Why did my book travel so well,

00:08:11.582 --> 00:08:15.499
to such different places,
like Iran and Israel.

00:08:18.199 --> 00:08:22.366
My highest readership per
capita is Iran and Israel.

00:08:25.172 --> 00:08:26.672
They have a 4.5...

00:08:29.054 --> 00:08:32.304
Every 4.5 house in these two countries,

00:08:33.371 --> 00:08:35.440
they have at least one book of mine.

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:37.445
So there is no recipe.

00:08:37.445 --> 00:08:38.725
From the moment that you try to

00:08:38.725 --> 00:08:40.752
find the recipe, I think you are lost

00:08:40.752 --> 00:08:43.396
because you lose the most
important thing in you.

00:08:43.396 --> 00:08:45.917
That it is your spontaneity.

00:08:45.917 --> 00:08:49.199
I would also like to
use the word innocence.

00:08:49.199 --> 00:08:51.891
Not innocence in the sense of being naive,

00:08:51.891 --> 00:08:54.589
but innocence in the sense of being

00:08:54.589 --> 00:08:56.687
open, of seeing everything as a

00:08:56.687 --> 00:08:59.604
child, and be amazed and surprised.

00:09:00.532 --> 00:09:05.005
And enjoy discovering
life every single day.

00:09:05.005 --> 00:09:09.172
You are here to honor something
called the miracle of life.

00:09:11.107 --> 00:09:15.274
You can be here to, well, to
fulfill your hours and days

00:09:16.661 --> 00:09:18.957
with something that is meaningless

00:09:18.957 --> 00:09:22.415
but you know that you
have a reason to be here.

00:09:22.415 --> 00:09:26.080
It is the only thing that
gives you enthusiasm.

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:28.528
Right, you know?
- Yeah.

00:09:28.528 --> 00:09:32.695
- And you know when you are
betraying your personal legend,

00:09:34.202 --> 00:09:38.815
when you are doing some
thing without enthusiasm.

00:09:38.815 --> 00:09:42.982
And worse, you know that
you have this good excuse,

00:09:45.073 --> 00:09:48.892
I'm not ready, which is just an excuse.

00:09:48.892 --> 00:09:50.958
No, they'll say, no, I'm not ready.

00:09:50.958 --> 00:09:53.857
I have to wait for the right moment.

00:09:53.857 --> 00:09:57.450
You know, now I have to feed my family.

00:09:57.450 --> 00:10:01.415
Come on, your family
wants to see you happy.

00:10:01.415 --> 00:10:03.218
- Yes.
- Your daughter.

00:10:03.218 --> 00:10:04.115
Your husband.

00:10:04.115 --> 00:10:05.597
Your wife.

00:10:05.597 --> 00:10:07.613
They don't want to see you there,

00:10:07.613 --> 00:10:10.644
sitting in a work that you hate.

00:10:10.644 --> 00:10:12.168
- Right.
- Even if it gives you

00:10:12.168 --> 00:10:13.863
tonnes of money.

00:10:13.863 --> 00:10:15.070
When my first book, The Alchemist,

00:10:15.070 --> 00:10:18.570
started being successful, I was already 42

00:10:20.210 --> 00:10:22.793
so I was mature enough to learn

00:10:23.828 --> 00:10:26.485
that everything's a gift and you have to

00:10:26.485 --> 00:10:28.873
treasure and respect it as a gift

00:10:28.873 --> 00:10:33.294
and not to be crazy
because you're successful.

00:10:33.294 --> 00:10:35.377
Before that huge success,

00:10:37.233 --> 00:10:40.650
very difficult times and I learned a lot.

00:10:42.274 --> 00:10:44.691
Luck, coincidence, and faith.

00:10:46.793 --> 00:10:50.694
In The Alchemist, I wrote,
"When you want something,

00:10:50.694 --> 00:10:54.861
"the whole universe will
conspire for you to have it."

00:10:58.091 --> 00:11:02.452
This means that when
you put your vibration,

00:11:02.452 --> 00:11:06.823
your energy, call it
whatever you want to call,

00:11:06.823 --> 00:11:10.990
into the air, somehow the
soul of the world is affected.

00:11:14.834 --> 00:11:19.001
I think that coincidence is
the language of the stars.

00:11:20.868 --> 00:11:23.095
For something to happen, so many

00:11:23.095 --> 00:11:25.762
forces have to be put in action.

00:11:26.997 --> 00:11:29.934
According to the ancient alchemists,

00:11:29.934 --> 00:11:32.517
and to the physicists of today,

00:11:33.804 --> 00:11:36.864
everything is one thing only.

00:11:36.864 --> 00:11:39.026
They would call it atom.

00:11:39.026 --> 00:11:41.950
Everything is made of atoms.

00:11:41.950 --> 00:11:44.867
If everything is totally connected,

00:11:46.142 --> 00:11:50.309
whatever you do interfere
in the rest of the world.

00:11:56.557 --> 00:12:00.307
So signs is when you
look around, and you see

00:12:02.434 --> 00:12:05.745
oh my God, the universe is talking to me.

00:12:05.745 --> 00:12:09.429
I have to understand this language.

00:12:09.429 --> 00:12:12.846
How can you understand any language is by

00:12:13.708 --> 00:12:15.125
taking the risks.

00:12:17.134 --> 00:12:20.646
Not being afraid of making mistakes.

00:12:20.646 --> 00:12:23.036
So, you start to learn this language

00:12:23.036 --> 00:12:27.203
using something you have
denied so far, your intuition.

00:12:29.175 --> 00:12:31.394
And you need to use your intuition

00:12:31.394 --> 00:12:33.517
and you need to be brave enough

00:12:33.517 --> 00:12:36.767
to dive deep into this unknown universe

00:12:38.628 --> 00:12:42.128
and say, I'm going to learn this language.

00:12:43.597 --> 00:12:44.692
- Thank you, guys, so much for watching.

00:12:44.692 --> 00:12:47.628
I made this video because
Andre F. asked me to

00:12:47.628 --> 00:12:48.783
so if there's a famous entrepreneur

00:12:48.783 --> 00:12:50.406
that you want me to profile next,

00:12:50.406 --> 00:12:52.648
leave it in the comments below
and I'll see what I can do.

00:12:52.648 --> 00:12:54.930
I'd also love to know
which of Paulo's comments

00:12:54.930 --> 00:12:56.855
made the biggest impact on you and why.

00:12:56.855 --> 00:12:58.951
What change are you going to
make in your business or life

00:12:58.951 --> 00:13:00.940
as a result of watching this video?

00:13:00.940 --> 00:13:03.908
Leave it in the comments and
I will join in the discussion.

00:13:03.908 --> 00:13:06.308
I also want to give a quick
shoutout to Dina Harbour

00:13:06.308 --> 00:13:08.564
from womenobtainingwealth.com.

00:13:08.564 --> 00:13:11.178
Dina, thank you so much for
buying a copy of my book.

00:13:11.178 --> 00:13:12.583
It really means a lot to me.

00:13:12.583 --> 00:13:13.998
For those of you watching,
if you want a chance

00:13:13.998 --> 00:13:15.640
at a shout-out in a future video,

00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:17.283
make sure to pick up a copy of the book

00:13:17.283 --> 00:13:19.578
and e-mail in your receipt
so we can keep track.

00:13:19.578 --> 00:13:21.702
Thank you, guys, so much for watching.

00:13:21.702 --> 00:13:23.331
Continue to believe, or whatever

00:13:23.331 --> 00:13:26.664
your one word is, and I'll see you soon.

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:34.263
- What is inspiration?

00:13:34.263 --> 00:13:38.712
Inspiration is (inhales) breathing.

00:13:38.712 --> 00:13:39.545
Right?

00:13:39.545 --> 00:13:41.712
So you put what is outside

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:44.787
inside of you.

00:13:44.787 --> 00:13:46.454
And then you expire.

00:13:47.767 --> 00:13:50.931
So, inspiration is something
that everybody has,

00:13:50.931 --> 00:13:52.880
not only writers,

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:54.713
everybody has what you

00:13:56.589 --> 00:14:00.154
or she, or he, do things with love.

00:14:00.154 --> 00:14:04.616
It is connected to this energy
that we don't understand.

00:14:04.616 --> 00:14:06.405
We can explain, explain, explain,

00:14:06.405 --> 00:14:09.773
but it is connected
with the energy of love.

00:14:09.773 --> 00:14:11.973
If you enjoy what you are doing,

00:14:11.973 --> 00:14:16.738
you are going to be inspired
to share with other people.

00:14:16.738 --> 00:14:20.905
However, inspiration, you
cannot guide inspiration.

00:14:23.348 --> 00:14:25.181
Inspiration is a boat,

00:14:26.620 --> 00:14:29.287
and you ride this boat in a sea.

00:14:31.293 --> 00:14:34.876
So there is this gigantic
sea and your boat

00:14:35.712 --> 00:14:39.007
is taking you, inspiration is guiding you.

00:14:39.007 --> 00:14:40.674
Inspiration is wind.

00:14:42.468 --> 00:14:45.885
That is guiding you towards your destiny.

00:14:47.635 --> 00:14:50.212
If you try to guide
inspiration, you are lost.

00:14:50.212 --> 00:14:51.508
You can read, of course, but

00:14:51.508 --> 00:14:55.084
then go and write a technical book.

00:14:55.084 --> 00:14:57.995
What you needed to do, what
at least I needed to do

00:14:57.995 --> 00:15:01.962
when I sit down to write,
is to have another idea,

00:15:01.962 --> 00:15:04.662
as I mention in my previous podcast,

00:15:04.662 --> 00:15:07.495
but then allow myself to be guided

00:15:09.161 --> 00:15:10.911
by just overall idea.

00:15:13.579 --> 00:15:17.279
I go into this boat of
inspiration, I sit in here.

00:15:17.279 --> 00:15:20.536
Every morning when I'm writing a new book,

00:15:20.536 --> 00:15:23.127
when I was writing Aleph,
normally I started at

00:15:23.127 --> 00:15:27.506
11 o'clock in the morning
and then, of course,

00:15:27.506 --> 00:15:29.896
I had the ideas of the previous night

00:15:29.896 --> 00:15:32.886
where I was upstairs in my bed,

00:15:32.886 --> 00:15:35.344
thinking, tomorrow I
need to write about this,

00:15:35.344 --> 00:15:39.456
this, and this, and this,
and I took a lot of notes.

00:15:39.456 --> 00:15:41.977
Then I sit here, I read
these notes, and I say,

00:15:41.977 --> 00:15:46.025
(scoffs) let's try to do this.

00:15:46.025 --> 00:15:48.708
But I know it's not going to work.

00:15:48.708 --> 00:15:52.126
And then you start using your notes

00:15:52.126 --> 00:15:55.424
to write the next page, the next chapter,

00:15:55.424 --> 00:15:58.007
but the notes are not connected

00:15:59.106 --> 00:16:02.739
with your inspiration, or my inspiration.

00:16:02.739 --> 00:16:07.427
So after half an hour,
trying to do this or that,

00:16:07.427 --> 00:16:10.084
I finally get into this boat because

00:16:10.084 --> 00:16:13.649
you need the discipline
also to go into this boat,

00:16:13.649 --> 00:16:16.316
and I allow myself to be guided.

